# Voice Recognition and Female Health Survey Refinements Plan

We will upgrade the voice transcription, speech flow, visual cues, and conditional logic for female health questions.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Immediate Voice Listening on Mic Click**:
>   We will change individual field microphone buttons to open the recording engine **immediately** without waiting for the question text-to-speech prompt. This eliminates the 4-6 second delay and allows users to speak instantly. The question speaker (Volume) button remains available for reading text.
> - **Input Field Visual Highlights**:
>   When a field is active for voice input, we will apply a pulsing red outline, pink ring, and background glow to the input container. We will also automatically focus the field and scroll it into view to guide the user.
> - **Female Health Gating**:
>   Female-specific fields (`menstrualCycleRegular`, `pregnant`, `pregnancyComplications`, and `previousSurgeries`) will be visible only when gender is `Female`. If the gender is changed from `Female` to `Male`/`Other`, these values will be automatically cleared to avoid data leakage or validation issues.

